    "DerivedData、SwiftPM、npm、Go 与 pip 缓存" : { "extractionState" : "manual", "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "DerivedData, SwiftPM, npm, Go, and pip caches" } } } },
    "GPL-3.0 许可证" : { "extractionState" : "manual", "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "GPL-3.0 License" } } } },
    "Helper 仅识别内置任务 ID，并使用固定绝对路径和参数。App 与 Helper 在 XPC 建连前会互相验证指定代码签名要求。" : { "extractionState" : "manual", "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "The helper accepts only built-in task IDs and uses fixed absolute paths and arguments. The app and helper verify each other's designated code-signing requirements before XPC connects." } } } },
    "Helper 响应与请求不匹配" : { "extractionState" : "manual", "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "The helper response does not match the request" } } } },
    "Helper 尚未启用或未获系统批准" : { "extractionState" : "manual", "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "The helper is not enabled or approved" } } } },
    "Helper 返回了无效响应" : { "extractionState" : "manual", "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "The helper returned an invalid response" } } } },
    "Helper 任务超时，连接已安全关闭。" : { "extractionState" : "manual", "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "The helper task timed out and the connection was closed safely." } } } },
    "Helper 连接超时；请检查签名、公证和系统批准状态。" : { "extractionState" : "manual", "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "The helper connection timed out. Check signing, notarization, and system approval." } } } },
    "Helper 连接已中断。" : { "extractionState" : "manual", "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "The helper connection was interrupted." } } } },
    "Macintosh HD" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Macintosh HD" } } } },
    "Mole 上游" : { "extractionState" : "manual", "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Mole upstream" } } } },
    "Spotlight 将重新索引启动磁盘，期间搜索结果可能不完整。" : { "extractionState" : "manual", "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Spotlight will reindex the startup disk. Search results may be incomplete until it finishes." } } } },
    "SpruceMyMac" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "SpruceMyMac" } } } },
    "SpruceMyMac 会先生成一次性计划；只有确认并再次通过路径与文件指纹校验后，选中项目才会进入废纸篓。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "SpruceMyMac first creates a one-time plan. Selected items move to Trash only after confirmation and another path and fingerprint check." } } } },
    "一年未修改" : { "extractionState" : "manual", "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Not modified for a year" } } } },
    "上次扫描" : { "extractionState" : "manual", "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Last scan" } } } },
    "不会在启动时自动扫描磁盘。仅统计你选择目录中的普通文件。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "No disk scan runs at launch. Only regular files inside the folder you choose are counted." } } } },
